**用户：**
还是跟不上，主要问题是，我在手指维持触屏的时候，它是能跟上的，就是我用力给一个速度，离开屏幕，速度很大，惯性很大的时候，它就跟不上了。

**AI：**
<think>The problem is clear now. When the user lifts their finger, the `touchend` event fires, which sets `boundaryTouchActive = false`. But the scroll inertia continues. The `scroll` event listener has a `SCROLL_THROTTLE =16ms` check, and only moves one step at a time.

The issue is that during fast inertia scrolling, the scroll position changes dramatically between frames, but the cursor only moves1 step per16ms. If the list items are ~32px tall and the scroll moves500px in500ms of inertia, that's ~15 items but the cursor only gets ~31 chances (500ms /16ms) to move1 step each =31 steps. That should be enough...

Wait, actually the real problem might be that `DOMQuerySelector` calls on every scroll event are expensive, causing the scroll handler to not fire frequently enough. Or maybe the `isNodeExpanded` check is slow.

Actually, let me think about this differently. The scroll event might not fire as frequently during inertia as during touch-driven scrolling. On mobile, inertia scrolling might be handled natively and the scroll events might be less frequent or batched.

The real solution: instead of relying on scroll events (which are inherently limited), use `requestAnimationFrame` polling to check if the cursor is in the constraint zone and move it if not. This way we're not dependent on scroll event frequency.

Let me rewrite the scroll handler to use rAF polling instead.</think>问题根因：惯性滚动时 `scroll` 事件频率不够高——浏览器在手指离开后惯性阶段的事件密度远低于触控阶段。

方案：不用 `scroll` 事件，改用 `requestAnimationFrame` 轮询。
<tool_1wlN name="package_proxy">
  <param name="params">{&quot;command&quot;: &quot;cat &gt; /tmp/fix_raf.py &lt;&lt; &apos;PY&apos;
with open(&apos;/root/kfmv4/src/client/modules/ui.ts&apos;, &apos;r&apos;) as f:
    content = f.read()

# 替换 scroll 事件为 rAF 轮询
old = &apos;&apos;&apos;  container.addEventListener(&apos;scroll&apos;, () =&gt; {
    const now = Date.now();
    if (now - lastScrollCheck &lt; SCROLL_THROTTLE) return;
    lastScrollCheck = now;
    if ((window as any).joystickActive) return;
    const sel = document.querySelector(&apos;.tree-item.selected&apos;) as HTMLElement | null;
    if (!sel) return;
    if (!isInConstraintZone(sel)) {
      const allVisible = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(&apos;#fileTree .tree-item&apos;)).filter(item =&gt; isNodeExpanded(item as HTMLElement)) as HTMLElement[];
      let idx = 0;
      allVisible.forEach((item, i) =&gt; { if (item === sel) idx = i; });
      const cr = container.getBoundingClientRect();
      const centerY = cr.top + cr.height / 2;
      const selRow = sel.querySelector(&apos;.tree-row&apos;) || sel;
      const selRect = selRow.getBoundingClientRect();
      const selCenter = selRect.top + selRect.height / 2;
      const scrollingUp = selCenter &gt; centerY;
      const nextIdx = scrollingUp ? Math.max(0, idx - 1) : Math.min(allVisible.length - 1, idx + 1);
      if (nextIdx !== idx) {
        moveCursorTo(allVisible[nextIdx]);
      }
    }
  });&apos;&apos;&apos;

new = &apos;&apos;&apos;  // rAF 轮询：不依赖 scroll 事件频率，每帧检测
  let scrollRafId = 0;
  let lastScrollPos = 0;
  const pollScroll = () =&gt; {
    scrollRafId = requestAnimationFrame(pollScroll);
    const sp = container.scrollTop;
    if (sp === lastScrollPos) return; // 没滚动就跳过
    lastScrollPos = sp;
    if ((window as any).joystickActive) return;
    const sel = document.querySelector(&apos;.tree-item.selected&apos;) as HTMLElement | null;
    if (!sel || isInConstraintZone(sel)) return;
    const allVisible = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(&apos;#fileTree .tree-item&apos;)).filter(item =&gt; isNodeExpanded(item as HTMLElement)) as HTMLElement[];
    let idx = 0;
    allVisible.forEach((item, i) =&gt; { if (item === sel) idx = i; });
    const cr = container.getBoundingClientRect();
    const centerY = cr.top + cr.height / 2;
    const selRow = sel.querySelector(&apos;.tree-row&apos;) || sel;
    const selRect = selRow.getBoundingClientRect();
    const selCenter = selRect.top + selRect.height / 2;
    const scrollingUp = selCenter &gt; centerY;
    const nextIdx = scrollingUp ? Math.max(0, idx - 1) : Math.min(allVisible.length - 1, idx + 1);
    if (nextIdx !== idx) {
      moveCursorTo(allVisible[nextIdx]);
    }
  };
  scrollRafId = requestAnimationFrame(pollScroll);&apos;&apos;&apos;

content = content.replace(old, new)
with open(&apos;/root/kfmv4/src/client/modules/ui.ts&apos;, &apos;w&apos;) as f:
    f.write(content)
print(&apos;done&apos;)
PY
python3 /tmp/fix_raf.py&quot;}</param>
